  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 100 × 25 - 10 ÷ 5 + 24 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after '+' and '-' are interchanged and also '×' and '÷' interchanged:\n\n100 × 25 - 10 ÷ 5 + 24 = ? ⇒ 100 ÷ 25 + 10 × 5 - 24 = ?\n\n⇒ __**100 ÷**____** 25**__ - 10 × 5 - 24 = ?\n\n⇒ 4 + __**10 **____**×**____** 5**__ - 24 = ?\n\n⇒ __**4**____** + 50**__ - 24 = ?\n\n⇒ __54** - 24**__ = ?\n\n**⇒ 30 = ?**\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
